WEBVTT

01:18.670 --> 01:21.960
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.990 --> 01:24.910
[Episode 18]

01:38.229 --> 01:38.870
Mr. Lu,

01:39.400 --> 01:41.660
is the boss of Qiansheng Group reliable?

01:43.150 --> 01:44.450
The introducer said

01:44.500 --> 01:46.430
he's quite laid-back
and easy to work with.

01:46.430 --> 01:48.830
And it's a well-established company, too.

01:49.979 --> 01:51.979
Let's just treat it as a last gamble.

01:56.390 --> 01:58.390
Here, have some tea.

02:00.590 --> 02:01.190
Thank you.

02:02.280 --> 02:02.960
Excuse me,

02:03.200 --> 02:04.130
could I ask,

02:04.190 --> 02:05.850
when will Chairman Li be back?

02:06.430 --> 02:07.710
Our appointment was at 4:00.

02:07.710 --> 02:09.830
It's almost 5:00 now.

02:10.910 --> 02:11.710
You two

02:11.800 --> 02:13.540
came at a bad time.

02:13.800 --> 02:14.680
My master

02:14.700 --> 02:16.870
takes his dog for a walk
every Wednesday afternoon in the suburbs.

02:16.870 --> 02:18.260
If he has fun,

02:18.400 --> 02:19.600
he might be a bit late.

02:20.910 --> 02:22.829
Jiang, what are you saying?

02:23.000 --> 02:23.910
No need to explain.

02:23.910 --> 02:24.910
I'm sorry.

02:24.910 --> 02:26.000
Please sit.

02:27.520 --> 02:28.680
Am I the one having fun,

02:28.680 --> 02:30.140
or is it the one having fun?

02:31.030 --> 02:33.160
I'm exhausted. I was chasing after it.

02:33.590 --> 02:34.190
Come here.

02:35.360 --> 02:36.160
Have some tea.

02:36.570 --> 02:37.820
Mr. Li, this is our...

02:38.600 --> 02:39.370
No need.

02:40.150 --> 02:41.350
I've already read it.

02:42.560 --> 02:43.760
I might

02:43.780 --> 02:44.780
be playful

02:45.079 --> 02:45.960
but I don't

02:46.630 --> 02:48.280
mess up my work.

02:51.310 --> 02:53.210
What are you doing? Want some tea?

02:54.280 --> 02:55.540
Can't you behave a bit?

02:56.630 --> 02:59.100
Mr. Li, about our project...

02:59.190 --> 03:00.240
I won't invest.

03:02.240 --> 03:02.910
Well,

03:02.940 --> 03:04.260
for your project,

03:05.470 --> 03:07.220
I don't see

03:07.710 --> 03:09.120
any ROI,

03:09.750 --> 03:11.150
timeline,

03:11.710 --> 03:13.240
or fallback plan.

03:16.430 --> 03:18.680
There's no clear direction,
no reliable timeline,

03:18.680 --> 03:20.630
and no way to predict
the return on investment.

03:20.630 --> 03:22.230
You're just selling a dream—

03:22.240 --> 03:24.030
and even that dream
belongs to someone else,

03:24.030 --> 03:25.360
And I have to pay for it.

03:26.560 --> 03:27.470
Is anyone

03:27.910 --> 03:28.840
in the world

03:29.560 --> 03:31.220
would do such a foolish thing?

03:32.680 --> 03:34.380
But don't be too upset.

03:34.840 --> 03:35.910
For young people,

03:37.150 --> 03:39.430
struggling and gaining experience

03:39.450 --> 03:40.840
isn't a bad thing.

03:41.530 --> 03:42.730
I stand by what I said.

03:43.030 --> 03:44.590
As long as the project is good,

03:44.590 --> 03:46.310
you're welcome.

04:19.160 --> 04:19.950
Who is it?

04:27.360 --> 04:29.300
You didn't reply to my texts
or answer my calls.

04:29.300 --> 04:30.570
What's wrong with you?

04:30.830 --> 04:32.040
What's wrong with you?

04:32.040 --> 04:33.570
Why are you being like this?

04:34.000 --> 04:36.310
What's wrong?
Are you cutting ties with me?

04:36.310 --> 04:38.110
What are you even talking about?

04:38.560 --> 04:40.780
Look at you, acting all cool.

04:40.830 --> 04:43.260
That's a suitcase full of cash
you're giving up.

04:43.260 --> 04:44.700
I didn't know

04:44.720 --> 04:46.290
you were so filthy rich.

04:46.560 --> 04:47.720
Wang Ruohai wouldn't accept it?

04:47.720 --> 04:48.680
Why would he?

04:49.070 --> 04:51.530
My business with him
is none of your concern.

04:57.870 --> 04:58.470
Well.

04:59.240 --> 05:00.960
I just want some personal space.

05:00.960 --> 05:02.450
Isn't that okay?

05:04.560 --> 05:06.750
Aren't you blaming me
for ruining Lu Ze's company?

05:06.750 --> 05:08.610
Will staying alone calm you down?

05:09.070 --> 05:10.330
What's wrong with you?

05:12.160 --> 05:14.490
The reassessment of Shan Li Fang's assets

05:14.510 --> 05:15.630
is your duty.

05:15.950 --> 05:17.880
Lu Ze's company is poorly managed,

05:17.940 --> 05:19.130
and its intangible assets are overvalued.

05:19.130 --> 05:21.070
With or without you,
it would've collapsed sooner or later.

05:21.070 --> 05:22.760
How could I blame you?

05:23.080 --> 05:24.480
Don't flatter yourself.

05:27.740 --> 05:30.140
It was my fault
for not telling you earlier.

05:30.270 --> 05:31.240
Exactly.

05:31.870 --> 05:33.630
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

05:36.950 --> 05:38.310
Why are you eating instant noodles again?

05:38.310 --> 05:40.430
Doesn't your Lu Ze always tell you
not to eat this?

05:40.430 --> 05:41.630
Don't talk nonsense.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.370
Since when is he mine?

05:43.480 --> 05:44.870
I have nothing to do with him.

05:44.870 --> 05:45.670
What's wrong?

05:46.360 --> 05:48.220
I get mad just talking about this.

05:49.000 --> 05:50.520
He can't take responsibility for himself

05:50.520 --> 05:52.000
and puts all the blame on you instead.

05:52.000 --> 05:53.680
No, he didn't.

05:54.190 --> 05:54.920
I really...

05:55.810 --> 05:57.290
I wasted 3 years with him.

05:57.670 --> 05:59.140
Something so big happened,

05:59.140 --> 06:01.430
and he didn't even tell me first.

06:02.430 --> 06:03.430
He told me

06:04.430 --> 06:06.150
he'd rather choose his career

06:06.750 --> 06:08.360
than our future.

06:11.600 --> 06:13.850
Why should I still be with him?

06:14.190 --> 06:15.190
What's the point?

06:15.510 --> 06:17.240
You should have told me earlier,

06:17.240 --> 06:18.930
so I could have known his choice

06:18.930 --> 06:20.360
and broken up with him earlier,

06:20.360 --> 06:22.360
instead of dragging it out till now.

06:22.830 --> 06:24.030
You broke up with him?

06:26.510 --> 06:27.000
Yeah.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.920
Put on your clothes and come with me.

06:37.190 --> 06:37.830
Let's go find Lu Ze.

06:37.830 --> 06:39.310
What for? I'm not going.

06:39.310 --> 06:40.870
I won't go.

06:41.560 --> 06:43.060
At a time like this,
you are making things worse

06:43.060 --> 06:44.390
by breaking up with him?

06:46.830 --> 06:48.880
Lu Ze has tried.

06:49.240 --> 06:50.390
He finally found a new buyer

06:50.390 --> 06:51.920
to take over Xinxin Vision.

06:52.000 --> 06:52.720
But to ensure a smooth IPO,

06:52.720 --> 06:53.790
Shan Li Fang

06:53.810 --> 06:55.140
went back on their word.

06:55.159 --> 06:57.020
It even cut off this path for him.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.560
I know.

07:00.390 --> 07:02.650
I never said he didn't try.

07:03.010 --> 07:04.010
It's just that...

07:06.120 --> 07:07.670
he's too calm.

07:07.950 --> 07:09.260
He's thought it all through

07:09.260 --> 07:10.980
and decided not to choose me.

07:11.360 --> 07:12.570
He wants to put everything he has

07:12.570 --> 07:14.040
into Xinxin Vision.

07:14.070 --> 07:15.910
That's his real baby.

07:16.070 --> 07:17.120
What am I?

07:17.680 --> 07:19.030
No matter what,

07:19.270 --> 07:20.370
at a time like this,

07:20.410 --> 07:22.140
he needs your comfort the most.

07:23.940 --> 07:25.070
I won't comfort him.

07:26.310 --> 07:27.890
I'm hurting too.

07:27.920 --> 07:30.450
Do you think only the one
who got dumped hurts?

07:32.430 --> 07:33.640
Losing me

07:34.390 --> 07:36.390
hurts him far less than losing

07:36.390 --> 07:37.720
his Xinxin Vision does.

07:38.190 --> 07:39.470
Let me tell you, Fei.

07:40.680 --> 07:42.520
Lu Ze is a startup guy.

07:43.800 --> 07:46.460
He can give up everything for his career.

07:46.480 --> 07:47.480
But what about me?

07:48.080 --> 07:48.560
Well.

07:48.720 --> 07:50.890
I can risk it all

07:50.920 --> 07:52.040
for a poor guy.

07:52.950 --> 07:55.240
But I'd never dare dedicate
the rest of my life

07:55.240 --> 07:57.440
to someone who values his career

07:57.460 --> 07:58.990
above all else.

08:03.920 --> 08:05.280
Do you still love him?

08:10.430 --> 08:11.000
I do.

08:11.720 --> 08:12.940
But in his heart,

08:14.070 --> 08:16.330
the company is the most important thing.

09:24.310 --> 09:25.110
Yao Jingjing.

09:26.280 --> 09:28.940
Although the ceremony isn't ready,

09:29.840 --> 09:31.540
my heart is.

09:35.680 --> 09:36.840
Will you marry me?

09:38.900 --> 09:40.030
I do.

09:56.510 --> 10:00.060
[Fulaxid Co., Ltd.]

10:00.130 --> 10:02.710
[Temperature] [Humidity]
[Light Exposure] [Growth Rate]

10:05.630 --> 10:06.990
This is

10:07.120 --> 10:08.830
Fulaxida's ongoing

10:08.850 --> 10:10.950
phase 3 core experimental scenario.

10:11.290 --> 10:13.260
It enables large-scale

10:13.470 --> 10:14.920
organic indoor farming

10:15.080 --> 10:16.360
in existing urban buildings

10:16.360 --> 10:17.960
with minimal retrofitting.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.840
If such planting centers

10:19.910 --> 10:23.000
are distributed throughout the city
in commercial districts,

10:23.000 --> 10:25.870
coupled with an efficient
logistics distribution system,

10:25.870 --> 10:27.980
it will make life

10:28.010 --> 10:29.450
more efficient

10:29.630 --> 10:31.510
and bring down costs.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.470
Today's inspection

10:35.470 --> 10:36.970
surprised me very much.

10:37.270 --> 10:38.130
It is very good.

10:38.760 --> 10:39.510
When I go back,

10:39.510 --> 10:40.790
I will introduce it

10:41.030 --> 10:42.440
to Mr. Sang thoroughly.

10:42.630 --> 10:43.310
Thank you.

10:43.550 --> 10:44.790
But before I leave,

10:45.200 --> 10:46.730
I want to ask you a question.

10:46.960 --> 10:47.550
Please.

10:48.550 --> 10:50.440
What got young people like you

10:50.910 --> 10:52.790
interested in agriculture,

10:53.440 --> 10:55.200
especially someone like you, Mr. Li—

10:55.200 --> 10:56.720
a rising star in finance

10:57.150 --> 10:58.150
and the son of an investment banker?

10:58.150 --> 10:59.320
I am very curious.

11:01.310 --> 11:02.660
Well, let me answer you.

11:04.320 --> 11:05.240
First of all, I believe that,

11:05.240 --> 11:07.040
from a historical point of view,

11:07.120 --> 11:08.150
agriculture has never

11:08.150 --> 11:09.710
been just about farming.

11:10.080 --> 11:12.840
At its core, it reflects
how humans have constantly

11:12.840 --> 11:14.910
reshaped nature and life.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.620
Think about it.

11:18.000 --> 11:21.200
From slash-and-burn farming
to intensive cultivation,

11:21.320 --> 11:23.250
and now to digital agriculture...

11:24.630 --> 11:26.600
Today, both China and the world

11:26.600 --> 11:27.630
are going through

11:28.390 --> 11:31.360
profound changes.

11:32.130 --> 11:33.410
For agriculture,

11:33.720 --> 11:35.080
those changes

11:35.320 --> 11:37.270
are being driven by technologies

11:37.360 --> 11:40.200
that combine advances in life sciences
with digital innovation.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.630
Agriculture may not sound like

11:41.630 --> 11:43.420
the most fashionable industry.

11:43.420 --> 11:47.060
[China Venture Capital Forum]

11:43.840 --> 11:46.840
Many people lose interest

11:46.840 --> 11:48.150
as soon as they hear the words
"rural development."

11:48.150 --> 11:49.360
But the reality is that technology

11:49.360 --> 11:51.400
has always been the force
that moves agriculture forward.

11:51.400 --> 11:52.550
Our digital agriculture platform

11:52.550 --> 11:55.030
uses connected sensors

11:55.150 --> 11:57.480
to automatically collect
a wide range of data

11:57.480 --> 11:59.360
and upload it to an IoT network.

11:59.510 --> 12:01.600
Through a mobile phone or computer,

12:01.670 --> 12:04.330
we can remotely monitor conditions
in the field

12:04.390 --> 12:07.060
and make better, data-driven decisions.

12:07.110 --> 12:09.310
With the right investment and support,

12:09.390 --> 12:10.390
we believe agriculture can become

12:10.390 --> 12:12.790
more connected, more transparent,
and more accessible than ever before.

12:12.790 --> 12:14.240
Agriculture no longer has to be defined

12:14.240 --> 12:16.980
by backbreaking labor in the fields.

12:17.630 --> 12:19.550
It can become part of a broader ecosystem

12:19.550 --> 12:21.350
of commerce and communication.

12:21.840 --> 12:24.270
Ultimately, that creates new opportunities
for rural communities

12:24.270 --> 12:26.470
and helps generate shared prosperity.

12:26.630 --> 12:28.030
As young entrepreneurs,

12:28.630 --> 12:29.720
we are proud to be part of this journey—

12:29.720 --> 12:31.400
one where technology

12:31.430 --> 12:32.670
empowers agriculture

12:32.670 --> 12:35.400
and drives innovation
across the food industry.

12:51.510 --> 12:52.320
Looking ahead,

12:52.320 --> 12:53.290
we will continue

12:53.320 --> 12:55.240
to refine agricultural production,

12:55.240 --> 12:56.270
advance our research

12:56.270 --> 12:58.270
in food science and the life sciences,

12:58.270 --> 13:00.780
and ensure that Fulaxida continues

13:00.840 --> 13:03.640
to grow strongly over the next ten
to twenty years.

13:04.030 --> 13:05.170
In my view,

13:05.360 --> 13:08.000
this is the kind of opportunity
that ambitious investors

13:05.740 --> 13:12.610
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

13:08.030 --> 13:09.430
should pay attention to.

13:10.150 --> 13:11.720
More importantly,

13:11.960 --> 13:12.870
it is an opportunity

13:12.870 --> 13:15.470
to grow alongside our society
and our country.

13:15.790 --> 13:16.630
That is why,

13:16.630 --> 13:18.480
in an age defined

13:18.480 --> 13:19.790
by technology and capital,

13:19.790 --> 13:22.720
we have chosen to focus
on the future of agriculture.

13:23.000 --> 13:26.510
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

13:24.120 --> 13:24.750
To our successful cooperation.

13:24.750 --> 13:26.550
To our successful cooperation.

13:32.280 --> 13:33.510
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

13:50.630 --> 13:53.320
Mr. Liao, your bunker shots are excellent.

13:53.630 --> 13:55.640
Your skills are top-notch.

13:56.120 --> 13:56.980
I'm impressed.

13:57.270 --> 13:58.600
You're flattering me, Mr. Sang.

13:58.600 --> 14:00.460
I'm just relying on my seniority.

14:01.480 --> 14:02.790
When it comes
to keeping up with the times,

14:02.790 --> 14:04.720
I still have much to learn from you.

14:04.910 --> 14:07.280
Mr. Liao, well,

14:07.630 --> 14:09.830
there is a hidden meaning in your words.

14:19.790 --> 14:22.390
I heard you invested
in a new project recently.

14:24.150 --> 14:26.480
I-It's just a small agricultural project

14:26.510 --> 14:28.170
started by a few young people.

14:28.790 --> 14:30.120
They don't have much money,

14:30.120 --> 14:31.450
so they came to me.

14:31.600 --> 14:33.790
Just a small project.

14:35.600 --> 14:38.510
It's Ma Li's Fulaxida.

14:41.750 --> 14:42.440
Mr. Liao.

14:42.790 --> 14:44.960
You even know about this?

14:46.910 --> 14:48.040
I just heard about it

14:48.960 --> 14:50.320
from someone.

15:04.320 --> 15:05.380
What are you doing?

15:05.510 --> 15:06.770
Acting all depressed?

15:07.150 --> 15:08.840
Why did you ask me to come here?

15:09.750 --> 15:11.510
Isn't your birthday coming up?

15:11.750 --> 15:12.750
I ordered a gift for you

15:12.750 --> 15:14.280
and came to pick it up today.

15:15.120 --> 15:16.030
Thanks.

15:17.120 --> 15:18.910
It's good to have a bro like you.

15:21.390 --> 15:23.870
Why are you so depressed
when receiving a gift?

15:23.870 --> 15:24.870
What's wrong?

15:27.120 --> 15:28.510
You're still sulking?

15:29.440 --> 15:30.960
You just got rejected by a girl.

15:30.960 --> 15:31.840
Is it that serious?

15:31.840 --> 15:32.830
Cheer up.

15:32.960 --> 15:34.020
Cheer up, cheer up.

15:35.150 --> 15:37.020
It's not that easy to cheer up.

15:37.630 --> 15:38.830
This time, really...

15:38.840 --> 15:41.010
I feel like I've lost my sense of worth.

15:42.840 --> 15:45.200
Haven't you always felt good
about yourself?

15:45.200 --> 15:46.270
How come you don't even know

15:46.270 --> 15:47.510
your own worth anymore?

15:47.510 --> 15:48.200
Look.

15:49.150 --> 15:50.270
Actually, I always thought

15:50.270 --> 15:52.120
my mom had everything figured out for me.

15:52.120 --> 15:53.720
Good school, good teachers,

15:53.750 --> 15:55.480
and a good job right after graduation.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.120
And

15:56.510 --> 15:58.200
all these years,
everything just worked out for me.

15:58.200 --> 15:59.510
I've never really had
to deal with pressure.

15:59.510 --> 16:00.370
But none of that

16:00.390 --> 16:01.440
mattered

16:02.030 --> 16:03.080
when it came to Dang Yu.

16:03.080 --> 16:04.630
It meant nothing to her.

16:04.630 --> 16:06.510
She knocked me off my high horse.

16:06.510 --> 16:09.240
I seriously started
questioning my entire life.

16:13.030 --> 16:14.890
You really got your heart broken.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.960
Jun, let me be honest with you.

16:17.960 --> 16:18.960
No need.

16:20.030 --> 16:22.480
Dang Yu already told me the truth.

16:24.150 --> 16:24.840
Work—

16:25.600 --> 16:26.840
my parents arranged it.

16:26.840 --> 16:27.320
Living—

16:27.480 --> 16:28.740
still with my parents.

16:28.840 --> 16:29.510
Money—

16:29.630 --> 16:31.160
my parents manage that too.

16:31.600 --> 16:33.260
How could an independent girl

16:33.320 --> 16:34.780
like her ever be into

16:34.870 --> 16:36.240
a man like me?

16:36.550 --> 16:37.510
Right.

16:37.720 --> 16:39.150
Since you've found the weak point,

16:39.150 --> 16:41.350
you should try hard to change it, right?

16:42.390 --> 16:43.270
Easier said than done.

16:43.270 --> 16:45.390
I've been like this for over 20 years.

16:45.910 --> 16:47.320
How can I change?

16:59.510 --> 17:00.790
Why can't you change?

17:01.880 --> 17:03.800
I've actually changed, you know.

17:04.480 --> 17:05.740
What have you changed?

17:07.589 --> 17:08.310
Look.

17:09.480 --> 17:11.140
Is there anything different?

17:13.310 --> 17:14.450
Nothing.

17:15.240 --> 17:16.569
Do you know what this is?

17:16.750 --> 17:18.760
The landlady ruined it in the wash

17:18.790 --> 17:20.369
and sewed it up for me.

17:20.920 --> 17:21.880
I'm even starting

17:21.880 --> 17:24.170
to wear mended clothes now.

17:25.109 --> 17:25.910
Stop joking.

17:26.109 --> 17:27.950
Don't you always send your clothes out
to be dry-cleaned?

17:27.950 --> 17:30.130
Yes, but now I machine wash them.

17:32.790 --> 17:33.350
Okay.

17:33.920 --> 17:34.780
Anything else?

17:34.830 --> 17:35.920
Anything else?

17:36.830 --> 17:39.890
I've started washing dishes
and buying groceries now.

17:40.160 --> 17:40.920
I don't believe it.

17:40.920 --> 17:42.590
I don't believe you would do them.

17:42.590 --> 17:43.510
Really.

17:43.680 --> 17:46.080
If I don't work,
the landlady won't feed me.

17:51.200 --> 17:51.880
Really?

17:55.830 --> 17:57.290
If your old man knew

17:57.310 --> 17:59.920
you were washing dishes
and buying groceries for your landlady,

17:59.920 --> 18:00.920
he'd be furious.

18:02.440 --> 18:03.960
Exactly.

18:04.790 --> 18:06.280
I've thrown my pride

18:06.310 --> 18:08.790
into the street and the sink.

18:09.240 --> 18:10.400
Haven't I changed?

18:13.480 --> 18:14.440
I get it.

18:15.590 --> 18:18.050
You're willing to change
for your landlady—

18:18.240 --> 18:19.240
that's true love.

18:19.510 --> 18:20.650
I get it too.

18:20.830 --> 18:22.270
You're not willing to change for Dang Yu—

18:22.270 --> 18:23.730
that isn't true love.

18:25.880 --> 18:27.330
I need to learn from you

18:27.920 --> 18:28.680
and change myself.

18:28.680 --> 18:29.270
Change.

18:29.440 --> 18:29.960
Change.

18:29.960 --> 18:30.510
Change.

18:30.640 --> 18:31.110
Change.

18:31.200 --> 18:32.200
Go. Change.

18:32.480 --> 18:33.550
Change, change, change.

18:33.550 --> 18:34.240
Change yourself.

18:34.240 --> 18:35.290
Change the world.

18:37.160 --> 18:37.970
You're back.

18:38.000 --> 18:38.640
Yes.

18:42.270 --> 18:43.450
Quick.

18:43.750 --> 18:46.110
I have something very important
to tell you.

18:46.110 --> 18:46.910
What is it?

18:48.000 --> 18:49.270
What important thing?

18:49.440 --> 18:51.030
Guess what I found.

18:51.110 --> 18:51.530
Look.

18:53.240 --> 18:55.840
Look at the details.
They are exactly the same.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.590
Didn't I keep my word?

18:57.590 --> 18:58.610
I told you before

18:58.640 --> 19:00.960
that I would compensate you
with an exactly identical one.

19:00.960 --> 19:02.000
Look how cheap it is.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.860
It's only 109 with free shipping.

19:04.680 --> 19:06.200
Such a fake knockoff—

19:06.200 --> 19:07.350
How could I wear it?

19:07.510 --> 19:09.620
Li Yifei, can you stop pretending?

19:09.720 --> 19:11.030
You always spend money so extravagantly.

19:11.030 --> 19:12.750
If you had saved a little,
you would have moved out long ago.

19:12.750 --> 19:13.680
You may not be able to buy a big house.

19:13.680 --> 19:15.160
But you could have bought a small one.

19:15.160 --> 19:16.220
Why buy a small one?

19:16.230 --> 19:17.760
Next time, I'll buy a villa.

19:19.070 --> 19:21.470
I think you should
buy some medicine first.

19:21.750 --> 19:23.350
I can't be bothered with you.

19:23.580 --> 19:24.460
Give me your phone.

19:24.460 --> 19:26.400
I'll download something good for you.
Quick.

19:26.400 --> 19:27.110
What for?

19:27.160 --> 19:27.920
I'll download an app for you

19:27.920 --> 19:29.650
and teach you how to save money.

19:29.920 --> 19:31.320
I don't know how to use it.

19:31.400 --> 19:32.070
What is it?

19:32.200 --> 19:33.640
Do you not want
the late-night meal tonight,

19:33.640 --> 19:35.700
or do you want to keep washing dishes?

19:37.070 --> 19:38.870
Now you're just acting all smug.

19:42.000 --> 19:42.830
Look.

19:47.680 --> 19:49.280
It's downloaded. This is it.

19:50.350 --> 19:51.810
Let me give you a nickname.

19:53.400 --> 19:54.400
Silly Li.

19:57.750 --> 19:58.750
Look, look, look.

20:00.640 --> 20:01.680
Isn't it cheap?

20:02.200 --> 20:03.510
This is only 40-something.

20:03.510 --> 20:04.250
Just like...

20:04.960 --> 20:07.750
I should have bought this instead.
It's only 40-something.

20:07.750 --> 20:08.680
I lost out.

20:08.680 --> 20:09.550
How about I return that one

20:09.550 --> 20:10.680
and buy this for you?

20:10.960 --> 20:11.510
It is 40-something

20:11.510 --> 20:13.110
and is exactly the same as yours.

20:13.110 --> 20:14.040
See if it's true.

20:16.680 --> 20:18.200
It really has everything in here.

20:18.200 --> 20:18.920
Let me tell you,

20:18.920 --> 20:20.960
everything we're missing at home,

20:21.000 --> 20:21.960
including what we have now—

20:21.960 --> 20:24.420
you can find the exact same one on it.
Really.

20:28.590 --> 20:29.320
You're back.

20:33.000 --> 20:34.350
Who gave you the gift?

20:35.510 --> 20:36.240
Yifei.

20:38.790 --> 20:40.650
What? Still mad at me?

20:42.750 --> 20:43.400
No.

20:44.240 --> 20:45.590
I heard about it.

20:46.310 --> 20:47.840
That girl is named Bad Name.

20:50.200 --> 20:51.800
You followed me again.

20:52.350 --> 20:54.790
I found out by accident.

20:57.310 --> 20:58.920
Forget it. It doesn't matter.

20:58.920 --> 21:00.880
I have nothing to do with her now anyway.

21:00.880 --> 21:02.000
You were right.

21:02.400 --> 21:03.440
She is Bad Name.

21:04.550 --> 21:05.410
Let me tell you.

21:05.510 --> 21:06.460
Your birthday is coming up.

21:06.460 --> 21:08.680
Ask Yifei and the others
to come over for a meal.

21:08.680 --> 21:10.190
Okay, I'll tell him later.

21:10.440 --> 21:11.830
Jun, right now...

21:11.920 --> 21:13.650
Well, how about this?

21:13.750 --> 21:15.070
You go over there right now.

21:15.070 --> 21:16.110
Look.

21:16.220 --> 21:17.280
I bought

21:17.310 --> 21:19.920
a box of cherries. They're very fresh.

21:19.940 --> 21:21.400
Take them to him right now.

21:21.880 --> 21:23.860
I just parted ways with him.

21:24.310 --> 21:25.790
But these cherries...

21:25.830 --> 21:27.790
They won't be fresh if put in the fridge.

21:27.790 --> 21:30.720
Hurry and take them to him
while they are fresh, okay?

21:31.160 --> 21:32.560
Thanks for your trouble.

21:36.960 --> 21:37.690
I'm leaving.

21:51.830 --> 21:53.400
I've taught you everything I can.

21:53.400 --> 21:55.360
The rest is up to you.

21:55.590 --> 21:56.650
Make good use of it.

21:57.030 --> 21:57.760
Are you done?

21:58.200 --> 21:58.750
Great.

22:01.780 --> 22:03.730
This is just the beginning.

22:04.350 --> 22:05.680
You and this app

22:05.750 --> 22:07.200
don't know each other well yet.

22:07.200 --> 22:07.960
But,

22:08.350 --> 22:10.350
trust me, given time,

22:11.070 --> 22:12.860
it will definitely meet
all your fashion needs

22:12.860 --> 22:14.260
at the lowest prices.

22:14.290 --> 22:16.490
You'll love it as much as you love money.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.110
Try it.

22:18.270 --> 22:20.550
Did you work in a pyramid scheme
before doing investment banking?

22:20.550 --> 22:21.810
Don't be so skeptical.

22:22.510 --> 22:23.270
Do you believe

22:23.270 --> 22:24.200
that for the clothes
you're wearing right now,

22:24.200 --> 22:25.350
I can find the exact same one?

22:25.350 --> 22:25.960
Yeah, yeah.

22:25.960 --> 22:26.790
Just take a photo,

22:26.790 --> 22:28.550
and you can find the exact same one.
Really.

22:28.550 --> 22:29.160
Yeah, yeah, I know.

22:29.160 --> 22:29.750
Look, look.

22:29.750 --> 22:30.440
Yeah, yeah, I know.

22:30.440 --> 22:31.200
Come on, come on, come on.

22:31.200 --> 22:33.000
Yeah, yeah. Fifty, thirty.

22:34.720 --> 22:36.050
I can't take it anymore.

22:40.750 --> 22:41.570
Who is it?

22:45.830 --> 22:46.440
It's Jun.

22:46.750 --> 22:47.550
Jun?

22:48.200 --> 22:48.590
Come in.

22:48.590 --> 22:49.850
Didn't you just leave?

22:50.240 --> 22:50.920
My mom

22:50.940 --> 22:52.740
asked me to bring you some fruit.

22:52.960 --> 22:53.940
You made a trip here yourself.

22:53.940 --> 22:54.940
That's really...

22:55.070 --> 22:56.310
Okay, hurry up, come in.

22:56.310 --> 22:57.170
Please come in.

22:57.350 --> 22:58.160
No need to take off your shoes.

22:58.160 --> 22:58.560
Okay.

23:05.550 --> 23:07.110
My birthday falls on a weekend.

23:07.110 --> 23:08.880
Why don't you guys come over together?

23:08.880 --> 23:09.540
OK.

23:10.960 --> 23:12.970
But I don't know your parents.

23:13.110 --> 23:14.110
So I shouldn't go.

23:14.790 --> 23:16.520
Do you really have to know them?

23:16.550 --> 23:17.200
What?

23:17.580 --> 23:19.580
You'll know them once you meet them.

23:19.790 --> 23:20.440
Let me tell you,

23:20.440 --> 23:21.590
his parents are really nice.

23:21.590 --> 23:22.920
And they cook really well.

23:22.920 --> 23:25.180
Besides, we're all good friends, right?

23:25.240 --> 23:27.100
Jun came all the way to invite you.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.130
What more do you want?

23:28.130 --> 23:29.190
Let's go together.

23:30.240 --> 23:31.940
If you really feel awkward,

23:32.240 --> 23:33.200
then...

23:33.590 --> 23:34.350
Then what?

23:35.920 --> 23:36.980
Ask Dang Yu to come.

23:39.920 --> 23:40.940
Forget it.

23:41.350 --> 23:42.750
She already rejected me.

23:43.550 --> 23:45.070
So what if she rejected you?

23:45.070 --> 23:46.600
Can't you still be friends?

23:46.680 --> 23:47.880
Take it easy.

23:48.070 --> 23:49.640
You have to be natural

23:49.680 --> 23:51.000
when interacting with her,

23:51.000 --> 23:53.030
and it will definitely have
a different effect.

23:53.030 --> 23:53.760
Understand?

23:55.000 --> 23:55.590
Really?

23:56.510 --> 23:58.160
Nonsense. Why would I to you?

23:58.200 --> 23:59.330
Of course it's true.

23:59.350 --> 24:00.070
Call her.

24:01.440 --> 24:01.980
What "ah"?

24:01.980 --> 24:03.240
Call her. Listen to me.

24:05.640 --> 24:07.570
Don't ask.
Just invite her to come.

24:22.440 --> 24:23.070
Hello.

24:23.720 --> 24:25.580
Hello, Yu. Are you busy right now?

24:25.750 --> 24:27.750
Getting ready for a game. What's up?

24:27.880 --> 24:28.550
Well,

24:28.720 --> 24:30.350
Jun's birthday is in a couple of days.

24:30.350 --> 24:32.010
Let's go celebrate together.

24:32.880 --> 24:33.690
I know.

24:33.720 --> 24:35.250
His mom already invited me.

24:39.030 --> 24:40.310
You get back to it.

24:40.330 --> 24:40.660
Okay.

24:44.720 --> 24:46.380
She said your mom invited her.

24:47.070 --> 24:48.270
My mom invited her?

24:48.310 --> 24:49.770
His mom invited her?

25:00.210 --> 25:01.420
[Join Fire Safety Efforts,
Build a Safe Community]

25:04.200 --> 25:05.680
You are all Jun's good friends.

25:05.680 --> 25:06.320
Auntie.

25:06.350 --> 25:07.110
It's good enough that you came.

25:07.110 --> 25:08.110
Auntie, this is for you.

25:08.110 --> 25:09.480
-What are you doing? Just come over.
-No need to bring anything.

25:09.480 --> 25:10.240
It's the least I could do.

25:10.240 --> 25:11.830
Why did you buy these things?

25:11.830 --> 25:12.450
Let me.

25:12.480 --> 25:13.400
Uncle, Auntie, let me introduce you.

25:13.400 --> 25:13.880
This is Qian Fei.

25:13.880 --> 25:14.550
Hello, Uncle and Auntie.

25:14.550 --> 25:14.880
Hello.

25:14.880 --> 25:15.750
This is Dang Yu.

25:15.750 --> 25:16.610
Hello, Auntie.

25:16.750 --> 25:17.820
Have a seat inside.

25:17.920 --> 25:18.590
Change your shoes.

25:18.590 --> 25:19.510
-No need, no need.
-It'll be ready soon.

25:19.510 --> 25:20.310
-No need, no need.
-It'll be ready soon.

25:20.310 --> 25:21.790
Okay, come in and have a seat.

25:21.790 --> 25:22.310
No need to change shoes.

25:22.310 --> 25:23.350
Come on, have a seat inside.

25:23.350 --> 25:24.400
Have a seat.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.130
Have a seat.

25:25.130 --> 25:25.640
Have a seat.

25:25.640 --> 25:26.400
Thank you, Uncle.

25:26.400 --> 25:28.110
Have some fruit first.

25:28.680 --> 25:29.670
-The dishes will be ready soon.
-Thank you, Auntie.

25:29.670 --> 25:30.480
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

25:30.480 --> 25:31.510
Help yourselves.

25:31.510 --> 25:32.840
Help yourselves. Okay.

25:34.030 --> 25:35.240
Auntie, do you need help?

25:35.240 --> 25:35.920
No need.

25:41.280 --> 25:44.140
Mom, how did you invite Dang Yu?

25:46.640 --> 25:48.640
As a friend's mother,

25:48.660 --> 25:49.940
I invited her.

25:50.750 --> 25:52.550
I was just worried you'd get mad.

25:53.310 --> 25:54.170
Thank you, Mom.

25:55.750 --> 25:57.160
It's just a meal today.

25:57.400 --> 25:58.640
Don't overthink it.

25:59.640 --> 26:00.830
But when dating,

26:00.960 --> 26:01.920
there's a lot you really

26:01.920 --> 26:03.450
need to figure out clearly.

26:03.750 --> 26:04.360
Right?

26:06.030 --> 26:06.640
All right.

26:16.960 --> 26:19.440
Happy birthday.

26:19.680 --> 26:20.540
Thank you.

26:21.510 --> 26:23.000
A year older.

26:26.000 --> 26:26.590
Yifei.

26:26.920 --> 26:28.790
You love these
braised bamboo shoots the most.

26:28.790 --> 26:30.020
I've been eyeing them for a while.

26:30.020 --> 26:31.270
-It's my favorite.
-You've been eyeing them for a long time.

26:31.270 --> 26:32.240
It's her specialty.

26:32.240 --> 26:33.530
Eat up. Have some.

26:33.920 --> 26:34.890
Thank you, Uncle.

26:34.890 --> 26:36.350
Isn't she pretty?

26:36.440 --> 26:37.900
Your name is Qian Fei, right?

26:37.900 --> 26:38.650
Yes, Auntie.

26:38.920 --> 26:39.850
You're so pretty.

26:39.850 --> 26:40.570
Thank you.

26:41.070 --> 26:42.000
Yifei told me

26:42.030 --> 26:44.930
you work at a financial company
in Lujiazui, right?

26:45.030 --> 26:45.790
Yes, Auntie.

26:45.810 --> 26:47.610
Yu and I work at the same company.

26:49.160 --> 26:51.500
Are your positions the same?

26:51.830 --> 26:52.350
Mom.

26:53.160 --> 26:54.270
Let's eat first, okay?

26:54.270 --> 26:55.530
Don't talk about work.

26:55.830 --> 26:57.750
Aren't we just chatting while eating?

26:57.750 --> 26:59.270
Right, just chatting.

26:59.270 --> 27:01.580
Auntie, my position is different
from Qian Fei's.

27:01.580 --> 27:02.880
She's in the business department.

27:02.880 --> 27:05.540
I work in administration.
I'm at the front desk.

27:06.830 --> 27:07.830
Administration?

27:07.920 --> 27:09.000
Front desk?

27:09.550 --> 27:11.240
The one who greets people

27:11.240 --> 27:12.440
and sends them off.

27:12.440 --> 27:13.900
That's what admin work is.

27:19.160 --> 27:20.750
I heard

27:20.850 --> 27:23.000
that the admins in the company

27:23.030 --> 27:24.510
are usually young girls

27:24.550 --> 27:25.880
from wealthy families.

27:25.950 --> 27:27.990
First, the job is very easy.

27:28.200 --> 27:30.260
They don't expect to make much money.

27:31.270 --> 27:32.000
Are you like that?

27:32.000 --> 27:32.830
Let's eat. Let's eat.

27:32.830 --> 27:33.920
I'm not like that, Auntie.

27:33.920 --> 27:34.960
I'm from Yunnan.

27:34.980 --> 27:36.440
I came to Shanghai to work.

27:36.590 --> 27:37.720
You are from Yunnan?

27:38.270 --> 27:39.360
From Yunnan?

27:40.480 --> 27:41.680
Yunnan is quite nice.

27:41.830 --> 27:43.310
A while ago, your aunt and I

27:43.400 --> 27:45.220
took a trip there.

27:46.030 --> 27:47.550
Places like Dali and Xishuangbanna

27:47.550 --> 27:49.350
have really beautiful scenery.

27:49.790 --> 27:51.320
That's just the scenery.

27:51.400 --> 27:54.580
Compared to Shanghai,
it's very backward.

27:54.680 --> 27:55.640
Mom.

27:56.400 --> 27:59.460
Economically, Shanghai is indeed
better than Yunnan.

27:59.510 --> 28:02.310
That's why I came to Shanghai
to develop my career.

28:04.510 --> 28:05.590
Let's eat. Let's eat.

28:05.590 --> 28:07.520
-Let's eat. Let's eat.
-Let's eat.

28:08.720 --> 28:11.440
So, for a front desk job like this,

28:11.550 --> 28:13.350
is there any room for promotion?

28:15.400 --> 28:17.460
Auntie, Yu is

28:17.480 --> 28:20.040
a typical multi-hyphenate professionals.

28:20.070 --> 28:22.240
The work she does in our company

28:22.240 --> 28:23.920
is just a small part of all her work.

28:23.920 --> 28:25.000
She is very capable.

28:25.000 --> 28:26.110
What does  multi-hyphenate mean?

28:26.110 --> 28:28.720
Being a multi-hyphenate means
there's a lot of freedom—

28:28.720 --> 28:29.790
really a lot of room to grow.

28:29.790 --> 28:31.070
It's relatively free.

28:31.270 --> 28:32.680
Young people nowadays

28:32.680 --> 28:33.880
want to do all sorts of things.

28:33.880 --> 28:35.440
They just want to be happy.

28:35.590 --> 28:35.990
Right.

28:36.030 --> 28:37.390
You like it, but...

28:37.590 --> 28:40.070
but whatever you do, you need
to have the ability to back it up.

28:40.070 --> 28:40.610
Right?

28:40.640 --> 28:42.440
You two can like whatever you want—

28:42.440 --> 28:44.090
one's a white-collar, the
other's a high-income professional.

28:44.090 --> 28:45.140
How happy you're.

28:45.590 --> 28:46.440
Well...

28:46.640 --> 28:48.360
Jun is quite happy, isn't he?

28:48.530 --> 28:50.420
Jun's situation is stable.

28:51.550 --> 28:52.350
Mom.

28:53.310 --> 28:54.790
My friends came
to celebrate my birthday with me,

28:54.790 --> 28:56.940
not to listen to your nonsense.

28:57.140 --> 28:59.320
You and Dad made such a big spread.

28:59.440 --> 29:01.080
But do you want me to be happy

29:01.110 --> 29:02.920
or do you just want to embarrass me?

29:02.920 --> 29:04.440
Did I embarrass you?

29:04.590 --> 29:06.680
Everything you just said
sounds kind of sharp.

29:06.680 --> 29:08.770
Was I being sharp? Yifei.

29:09.110 --> 29:09.920
Yifei, you tell me,

29:09.920 --> 29:11.050
w-was I being sharp?

29:11.070 --> 29:12.540
They can hear you.

29:12.880 --> 29:14.460
T-This fish has bones.

29:14.680 --> 29:16.200
Why do you always do this?

29:16.350 --> 29:18.920
-It's just a meal, and you're blaming me?
-Okay. Let's eat.

29:18.920 --> 29:19.880
They just didn't say it, but...

29:19.880 --> 29:20.940
Uncle, Auntie,

29:21.440 --> 29:23.350
I actually have something to do today.

29:23.350 --> 29:24.480
I should get going.

29:24.550 --> 29:25.830
Take your time eating.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.790
Oh no, this...

29:29.480 --> 29:30.440
Goodbye, Uncle and Auntie.

29:30.440 --> 29:31.160
What are you doing?

29:31.160 --> 29:32.490
Jun, what are you doing?

29:32.680 --> 29:34.640
Be sensible, okay?

29:35.110 --> 29:36.160
What are you doing?

29:36.160 --> 29:36.890
I'm leaving.

29:38.830 --> 29:39.960
-It's OK, Auntie.
-Auntie.

29:39.960 --> 29:41.060
L-Let's just eat.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.810
Such good food, right?

29:42.880 --> 29:43.960
All of a sudden,

29:43.960 --> 29:45.920
he is acting like this.

29:46.720 --> 29:47.680
They really have something to do.

29:47.680 --> 29:48.720
They just told me.

29:48.720 --> 29:50.380
They are really busy. Come on.

29:51.070 --> 29:52.870
Come, Uncle, let's have a drink.

29:53.160 --> 29:53.960
I'm sorry.

29:54.160 --> 29:56.490
I really didn't know
my mom would say that.

29:56.680 --> 29:57.550
It's fine.

29:58.680 --> 29:59.590
Thank you.

30:01.270 --> 30:02.200
For what?

30:02.960 --> 30:05.680
For not listening to your mom this time.

30:12.400 --> 30:14.700
[Delicious cakes]

30:15.000 --> 30:15.590
Jun's mom

30:15.590 --> 30:17.350
really set up a trap.

30:18.830 --> 30:21.160
You can also look at it
from another angle.

30:22.240 --> 30:23.670
Auntie's words

30:24.000 --> 30:25.680
made Jun reveal a different side

30:25.680 --> 30:26.920
of himself to Dang Yu.

30:28.640 --> 30:29.510
True.

30:30.920 --> 30:32.210
Okay. Hurry back.

30:32.240 --> 30:33.720
I really have a part-time job.

30:33.720 --> 30:34.590
Then, when

30:35.200 --> 30:37.440
can we see each other again?

30:38.640 --> 30:40.370
Depends on when I have time off.

30:40.590 --> 30:41.110
I'm off.

30:41.830 --> 30:43.070
Byebye, Fei and Yifei.

30:43.070 --> 30:43.790
Bye-bye.

30:46.780 --> 30:48.690
[Fruits]

30:50.750 --> 30:51.510
Jun.

30:52.880 --> 30:53.880
Looks promising.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.790
If you're determined to go after her,

30:56.790 --> 30:58.850
you absolutely must not let her down.

31:03.720 --> 31:04.400
Let's go.

31:04.550 --> 31:05.270
Go, go, go.

31:06.880 --> 31:07.720
Makes sense.

32:00.820 --> 32:03.670
