32:15.740 --> 32:17.480
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

32:18.180 --> 32:21.880
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

32:22.520 --> 32:26.120
♪ You always easily arouse my desire
to protect you ♪

32:26.650 --> 32:28.200
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

32:28.750 --> 32:30.240
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

32:30.770 --> 32:33.080
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

32:33.590 --> 32:35.190
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

32:35.500 --> 32:39.240
♪ Why is it you again?
In such a sweet tone ♪

32:36.490 --> 32:42.010
[Housework Price List]

32:39.690 --> 32:43.750
♪ It's like the whole world knows
I miss you ♪

32:44.370 --> 32:48.050
♪ Why is it always you?
With a cool chuckle ♪

32:48.040 --> 32:51.050
[Housework Price List]

32:48.510 --> 32:52.390
♪ Let me play along and protect you ♪

32:52.780 --> 32:56.640
♪ Why is it always you,
with that smile on your lips ♪

32:57.110 --> 33:00.990
♪ I blurt out I like you,
and I only like you ♪

33:06.930 --> 33:08.150
[Housework Price List]

33:19.420 --> 33:22.590
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

33:23.350 --> 33:26.970
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

33:27.600 --> 33:29.360
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

33:29.790 --> 33:31.400
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

33:31.780 --> 33:33.950
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

33:34.340 --> 33:35.990
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

33:46.200 --> 33:47.200
Do you want to die?

33:49.000 --> 33:49.550
Go back.

33:50.040 --> 33:53.650
♪ Why is it always you,
with that smile on your lips ♪

33:50.350 --> 33:51.110
No, no

33:54.370 --> 33:58.060
♪ I blurt out I like you,
and I only like you ♪

34:18.370 --> 34:20.710
You should focus when studying, right?

34:20.739 --> 34:22.250
If you study while doing chores,

34:22.250 --> 34:23.850
how can you absorb anything?

34:24.230 --> 34:25.840
The IB qualification exam is coming up.

34:25.840 --> 34:27.360
I have to work during the day,

34:27.360 --> 34:28.889
so I can only study at night.

34:29.070 --> 34:30.550
It's fine to study hard.

34:31.230 --> 34:32.230
But to multitask,

34:32.230 --> 34:33.929
you need a high enough IQ.

34:35.280 --> 34:36.810
Who are you looking down on?

34:39.440 --> 34:41.710
We'll see if you're smart enough
once we test you.

34:41.710 --> 34:42.360
Go ahead.

34:43.630 --> 34:45.489
I'll test you on what you've read.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.320
Let me see.

34:52.070 --> 34:52.840
Question:

34:53.120 --> 34:55.929
In 1991, the Zhengzhou Grain Market opened

34:55.960 --> 34:57.550
and introduced the trading mechanism.

34:57.550 --> 35:00.710
It marked the real beginning
of options trading in China.

35:00.710 --> 35:02.710
What do you think of this statement?

35:03.080 --> 35:04.480
That statement is incorrect.

35:04.480 --> 35:06.760
What this market introduced
was the futures trading mechanism.

35:06.760 --> 35:08.000
And it marked the beginning

35:08.000 --> 35:09.600
of futures trading in China.

35:14.320 --> 35:15.960
What does base money specifically include?

35:15.960 --> 35:17.440
Base money,
also known as high-powered money,

35:17.440 --> 35:18.760
refers to currency in circulation

35:18.760 --> 35:20.800
plus bank reserves.

35:20.800 --> 35:22.290
Base money is also known as Mb.

35:22.290 --> 35:23.410
Mb = C+R,

35:23.470 --> 35:24.530
where C is currency in circulation

35:24.530 --> 35:26.120
and R is bank reserves.

35:26.150 --> 35:28.750
The sum of them
equals the amount of base money.

35:30.480 --> 35:32.140
Now, a calculation question.

35:33.590 --> 35:36.070
Company A produces only one product.

35:36.110 --> 35:38.040
Its variable cost ratio is 60%,

35:38.110 --> 35:40.510
and its break-even operating ratio is 30%.

35:40.550 --> 35:43.630
What is the EBIT margin?

35:43.760 --> 35:45.320
EBIT margin =

35:45.320 --> 35:47.410
contribution margin ratio
× margin of safety ratio

35:47.410 --> 35:50.360
= (1 − break-even operating ratio)

35:50.410 --> 35:52.480
× (1 − variable cost ratio)

35:52.510 --> 35:53.670
= (1 − 30%)

35:53.670 --> 35:54.710
× (1 − 60%)

35:54.760 --> 35:56.360
= 28%.

36:00.510 --> 36:01.420
Sorry.

36:01.760 --> 36:02.800
When I was in school,

36:02.800 --> 36:04.320
everyone called me Feibaba

36:04.320 --> 36:05.850
because I was a top student.

36:08.480 --> 36:09.350
I'm sorry.

36:09.810 --> 36:11.360
I am also Feibaba.

36:11.920 --> 36:13.430
I don't care what you are.

36:14.150 --> 36:16.160
Just don't think I'm a fool.

36:25.190 --> 36:27.950
I wish Feibaba passes every exam.

36:28.400 --> 36:30.240
Pass every exam!

36:30.880 --> 36:32.630
Pass every exam!

36:32.690 --> 36:33.170
Pass—

36:41.560 --> 36:47.700
