36:41.880 --> 36:42.400
Hey, kid.

36:42.400 --> 36:44.200
Learn about waste sorting, kid.

36:48.840 --> 36:49.770
Please take one.

36:50.610 --> 36:51.110
Thank you.

36:51.110 --> 36:52.110
Don't mention it.

36:53.100 --> 36:54.750
[Cigarettes & Liquor]

36:54.580 --> 36:55.540
Fire safety.

36:55.670 --> 36:56.030
Okay.

37:02.800 --> 37:03.920
Why are you here?

37:04.340 --> 37:06.540
Didn't we say we'd meet during my break?

37:08.960 --> 37:09.730
Let me help you.

37:09.730 --> 37:12.390
I'm working part-time
as your volunteer today.

37:12.440 --> 37:13.410
Just to be clear.

37:13.510 --> 37:15.240
Volunteers don't get paid.

37:15.550 --> 37:17.480
Then I'll just consider it volunteer work.

37:17.480 --> 37:18.280
Give it to me.

37:18.590 --> 37:20.780
I'll leave these to you. Thanks.

37:21.810 --> 37:25.820
[Fruits]

37:23.000 --> 37:24.310
Come, take a look.

37:25.000 --> 37:27.360
Jun, is that your girlfriend?

37:28.760 --> 37:29.760
Not yet.

37:31.320 --> 37:33.000
You should act fast on a good match.

37:33.000 --> 37:33.840
Go for it.

37:37.360 --> 37:38.630
Fire safety info, take a look.

37:38.630 --> 37:39.420
Okay.

37:40.280 --> 37:42.340
Hello. Fire safety info, take a look.

37:46.480 --> 37:48.320
Hello. Fire safety info, take a look.

37:48.320 --> 37:49.800
Hello, your check-in is complete.

37:49.800 --> 37:51.110
Please take your room card.

37:51.110 --> 37:51.710
Thank you.

37:52.960 --> 37:54.460
This... this clip

37:55.000 --> 37:55.840
is from your hotel, right?

37:55.840 --> 37:56.630
What?

37:56.920 --> 37:58.030
I knew it.

37:59.000 --> 38:01.200
It's trending online. That's awesome.

38:01.200 --> 38:03.270
Sorry, I'm not sure about this.

38:03.320 --> 38:04.840
Then I'll post one, too.

38:07.190 --> 38:08.320
Look, everyone.

38:08.400 --> 38:10.920
This is where the jerk and the mistress

38:11.000 --> 38:11.960
got beaten up last time.

38:11.960 --> 38:13.190
I'm at the Shan Li Fang Hotel.

38:13.190 --> 38:14.520
It's already trending.

38:15.230 --> 38:17.830
Where the jerk and that mistress
got beaten up.

38:25.320 --> 38:25.920
Hello.

38:26.590 --> 38:28.190
The guys from those platforms we contacted

38:28.190 --> 38:29.760
returned all the red packets.

38:29.760 --> 38:31.920
They should have told us
they wouldn't help.

38:31.920 --> 38:32.840
I'm so mad.

38:33.150 --> 38:34.150
What should we do?

38:34.280 --> 38:36.550
That matter you mentioned
wasn't covered up.

38:36.550 --> 38:37.810
It's trending online.

38:38.480 --> 38:39.320
I know.

38:39.960 --> 38:42.760
Someone must be messing around
behind the scenes.

38:42.880 --> 38:44.410
I'll figure something out.

38:47.030 --> 38:49.030
-Tangtang.
-How can he be like that?

38:49.150 --> 38:50.880
I really couldn't tell before.

38:51.030 --> 38:52.200
Look at the video.

38:53.150 --> 38:54.360
This video has gone viral now.

38:54.360 --> 38:56.780
Yeah, Vice President Liao
shouldn't act like this.

38:56.780 --> 38:57.740
Wang Ruohai.

38:57.810 --> 39:00.140
O-Our company has completely gone viral.

39:00.510 --> 39:02.440
Look at the comments. Look at them.

39:02.600 --> 39:03.440
Isn't this bullying?

39:03.440 --> 39:05.920
H-Hasn't our company gone viral?

39:06.100 --> 39:07.500
Look. Look at the number of shares.

39:07.500 --> 39:08.780
-The number of shares.
-Oh, no.

39:08.780 --> 39:09.940
-They're all so high.
-Yes.

39:09.940 --> 39:11.570
-So many people know it.
-Of course.

39:11.570 --> 39:13.660
Onlookers love
to watch this kind of stuff.

39:13.660 --> 39:14.410
-I guess
-I always

39:14.410 --> 39:17.670
-it's not just this short-video platform—
-thought he wasn't a good guy.

39:17.670 --> 39:19.170
this stuff is probably
all over the internet now.

39:19.170 --> 39:21.200
Actually, Director Wang is quite pitiful.

39:21.200 --> 39:22.520
He just looks like...

39:22.540 --> 39:25.150
I saw it after work yesterday.

39:25.670 --> 39:26.670
Really?

39:26.800 --> 39:29.060
What are you watching during work hours?

39:30.400 --> 39:31.070
Boss.

39:31.400 --> 39:32.680
We are here to work,

39:32.710 --> 39:34.280
not to watch the fun.

39:35.380 --> 39:40.050
[Office Area]

39:35.710 --> 39:36.070
I...

39:36.150 --> 39:37.000
Just...

39:37.020 --> 39:38.950
just do what you're supposed to do.

39:50.980 --> 39:53.120
[Office Area]

39:57.550 --> 39:59.200
Y-You all heard that.

40:12.400 --> 40:13.260
Director Fang.

40:13.920 --> 40:14.980
Take a look at this.

40:22.810 --> 40:23.730
This

40:23.760 --> 40:25.340
has blown up online,

40:25.480 --> 40:27.280
and it all started with Qian Fei.

40:27.280 --> 40:28.380
Isn't this bad for He Jing's

40:28.380 --> 40:30.140
reputation?

40:46.860 --> 40:48.480
It might not be a bad thing.

40:58.670 --> 40:59.960
I'll notify Fang Yun

41:00.110 --> 41:02.030
to have Qian Fei transferred tomorrow.

41:02.030 --> 41:04.360
We can't let her stay
in the group anymore.

41:04.360 --> 41:06.230
You are in such a hurry just for this?

41:06.230 --> 41:07.890
Did my dad put pressure on you?

41:08.440 --> 41:09.280
Of course not.

41:09.590 --> 41:10.840
It's my own idea.

41:11.230 --> 41:13.890
I don't want you to be implicated
because of her.

41:16.070 --> 41:17.650
Have you watched this video?

41:17.650 --> 41:19.720
I know it all. No need to watch.

41:20.030 --> 41:22.160
They've doxxed you. Aren't you angry?

41:22.520 --> 41:23.870
Now that it's blown up,

41:23.920 --> 41:25.450
we can't transfer her away.

41:25.510 --> 41:26.960
If we transfer her now,

41:27.190 --> 41:28.520
people will doubt

41:28.550 --> 41:32.080
whether you are using your position
to avenge a personal wrong.

41:32.830 --> 41:34.430
Why are you speaking for her?

41:35.030 --> 41:36.590
I'm protecting you.

41:58.000 --> 41:59.190
Time to eat.

42:07.450 --> 42:14.510
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

42:15.510 --> 42:21.700
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

42:22.490 --> 42:28.730
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

42:30.240 --> 42:36.240
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

42:37.210 --> 42:40.950
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

42:41.870 --> 42:45.750
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

42:46.200 --> 42:51.530
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

42:52.190 --> 42:53.760
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.330 --> 42:56.260
Director Fang asked me
to organize

42:56.280 --> 42:57.320
your work details immediately.

42:57.320 --> 42:58.520
For today's meeting,

42:58.740 --> 43:00.140
you don't need to attend.

43:02.070 --> 43:02.760
Ms. Qian.

43:03.260 --> 43:05.120
Do we really have to be so distant?

43:05.360 --> 43:06.090
Come with me.

43:06.590 --> 43:07.760
What are you doing?

43:07.840 --> 43:08.800
Let go.

43:13.890 --> 43:14.730
Li Yifei.

43:16.800 --> 43:17.760
I suddenly feel

43:18.670 --> 43:20.920
it wouldn't be appropriate

43:21.000 --> 43:22.050
if we keep living together like this.
